agents.prompt:
I have extracted from the pathway an entry representing a group of genes with the following internal KEGG symbols:
{Symbols}

All these genes encode proteins that have the same role in an entry of the pathway, i.e., the resulting proteins can perform the same task in the same spot in a chain of the pathway proteins. Can you propose a generic symbol that represents these genes roles? This is a short symbol to be used to generically represent the group in the pathway illustration.
